{% extends 'layout.html.twig' %}
{% block content %}
<p>Hello{% if GivenName is not empty %} {{ GivenName }}{% endif %},</p>
<p>you deleted your account at {{ SchoolName }}. You can no longer sign in with this address, and your calendar links no longer work.</p>
<p>The school keeps what it has to keep, such as receipts, and your bookings as its history. To have your personal data exported or erased as well, contact {{ SchoolName }}.</p>
<p>If this was not you, contact {{ SchoolName }} right away.</p>
<p>Kind regards,<br>{{ SchoolName }}</p>
{%- endblock %}
